# devops-nexus npm face (ADR-0010, Verdaccio) -- any token authenticates, same local-only
# posture as the Python face's `-a . -P .`. Does not touch the default registry for ordinary
# deps -- scoped to this one host only.
#
# The index lives on the estate's always-on Kubernetes hub (ADR-0011): ONE address that
# answers from a host venv, from a running container and from a Docker build sandbox alike.
# Its canonical value lives in strategy-devops-excellence/governance/estate-nexus.env.
@platform:registry=http://192.168.50.228:4873/
//192.168.50.228:4873/:_authToken=devops-nexus-local
